81\" class=\"usc external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003e1281\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href=\"https://www.govinfo.gov/link/uscode/8/1282\" class=\"usc external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003e1282\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href=\"https://www.govinfo.gov/link/uscode/8/1301\" class=\"usc external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003e1301-1305\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href=\"https://www.govinfo.gov/link/uscode/8/1357\" class=\"usc external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003e1357\u003c/a\u003e, and \u003ca href=\"https://www.govinfo.gov/link/uscode/8/1372\" class=\"usc external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003e1372\u003c/a\u003e; sec. 643, \u003ca href=\"https://www.govinfo.gov/link/plaw/104/public/208\" class=\"publ external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003ePub. L. 104-208\u003c/a\u003e, 110 Stat. 3009-708; \u003ca href=\"https://www.govinfo.gov/link/plaw/106/public/386\" class=\"publ external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003ePub. L. 106-386\u003c/a\u003e, 114 Stat. 1477-1480; section 141 of the Compacts of Free Association with the Federated States of Micronesia and the Republic of the Marshall Islands, and with the Government of Palau, \u003ca href=\"https://www.govinfo.gov/link/uscode/48/1901\" class=\"usc external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003e48 U.S.C. 1901\u003c/a\u003e note and \u003ca href=\"https://www.govinfo.gov/link/uscode/48/1931\" class=\"usc external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003e1931 note\u003c/a\u003e, respectively; \u003ca href=\"https://www.govinfo.gov/link/uscode/48/1806\" class=\"usc external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003e48 U.S.C. 1806\u003c/a\u003e; \u003ca href=\"/on/2026-10-20/title-8/part-2\" class=\"cfr external\"\u003e8 CFR part 2\u003c/a\u003e; \u003ca href=\"https://www.govinfo.gov/link/plaw/115/public/218\" class=\"publ external\" target=\"_bl